## 📝 Typographie

### Font Family

```css
--hv-font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
--hv-font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Cascadia Mono', 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace;
```

### Font Sizes

```css
--hv-font-size-micro: 10px;
--hv-font-size-xs: 11px;
--hv-font-size-sm: 12px;
--hv-font-size-base: 14px;    /* Base recommandée */
--hv-font-size-md: 16px;
--hv-font-size-lg: 18px;
--hv-font-size-xl: 20px;
--hv-font-size-2xl: 24px;
--hv-font-size-3xl: 28px;
--hv-font-size-4xl: 30px;
```

### Font Weights

```css
--hv-font-weight-regular: 400;
--hv-font-weight-medium: 500;
--hv-font-weight-semibold: 600;
--hv-font-weight-bold: 700;
```

### Line Heights

```css
--hv-line-height-tight: 1.2;
--hv-line-height-normal: 1.5;
--hv-line-height-relaxed: 1.75;
```

---

## ⏱️ Transitions & Animations

```css
--hv-transition-fast: 150ms;
--hv-transition-base: 200ms;
--hv-transition-slow: 300ms;
--hv-transition-slower: 500ms;

--hv-ease-default: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
--hv-ease-in: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1);
--hv-ease-out: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1);
--hv-ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
--hv-spring-easing: cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
```

### Utilisation

```svelte
<style>
  .button {
    transition: all var(--hv-transition-base) var(--hv-ease-default);
  }
</style>
```

---

## 🏗️ Z-Index Scale

```css
--hv-z-base: 0;
--hv-z-dropdown: 1000;
--hv-z-sticky: 1100;
--hv-z-fixed: 1200;
--hv-z-modal-backdrop: 1300;
--hv-z-modal: 1400;
--hv-z-popover: 1500;
--hv-z-tooltip: 1600;
--hv-z-notification: 1700;
--hv-z-topbar: 1800;
--hv-z-launcher: 1900;
```

