## 🧩 Classes de Composants Disponibles

### Boutons

```svelte
<button class="hv-btn hv-btn-primary">Primary</button>
<button class="hv-btn hv-btn-secondary">Secondary</button>
<button class="hv-btn hv-btn-danger">Danger</button>
<button class="hv-btn hv-btn-ghost">Ghost</button>

<!-- Tailles -->
<button class="hv-btn hv-btn-sm">Small</button>
<button class="hv-btn">Default</button>
<button class="hv-btn hv-btn-lg">Large</button>
```

### Cartes

```svelte
<div class="hv-card">
  <div class="hv-card-header">
    <h3 class="hv-card-title">Titre</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="hv-card-content">
    Contenu
  </div>
</div>
```

### Inputs

```svelte
<input type="text" class="hv-input" placeholder="Texte..." />
<textarea class="hv-textarea"></textarea>
<select class="hv-select">
  <option>Option 1</option>
</select>
```

### Badges

```svelte
<span class="hv-badge hv-badge-success">Success</span>
<span class="hv-badge hv-badge-warning">Warning</span>
<span class="hv-badge hv-badge-error">Error</span>
<span class="hv-badge hv-badge-info">Info</span>
```

### Menus

```svelte
<div class="hv-menu">
  <button class="hv-menu-item">
    <Icon />
    Menu Item
  </button>
  <div class="hv-menu-separator"></div>
  <button class="hv-menu-item">
    Another Item
  </button>
</div>
```

